# TextMap_PutDigit: a nonzero leading digit (ruling 5, 2), at its first call (TextMap_CmdNumber /
# TextMap_CmdNumberPlus1 printing a number: a5/d6/a6 the text map state): d0 = the divu result 1
# (quotient 1, remainder 0), d1 = 0 (no digit yet), so it writes the digit tile. A real state: the
# options screen's music test 10-16 and sound test 10-58 ($F60A max $F, $F60C max $39, shown plus
# one: TextMap_CmdNumberPlus1); scenario-options never steps them past 9.

case digit_1
reg d0 = $00000001
reg d1 = 0
